                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">  
The Board of Directors has had the opportunity to review your performance after the completion of your 6 months’ probation period, and noted that your performance has been good.


I am pleased to inform you that in recognition of your effort, the Board of Directors has confirmed you in the position of </Value>
