                      <Color>#000000</Color>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">.


The Society expects that you will maintain the same level of enthusiasm and enterprise which you have exhibited during the six months of your probation.

On behalf of the Board and on my own behalf, I congratulate you and wish you success in your new position.



Solomon A Atsiaya
CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER 
</Value>
